  "narration": {
    "title": "Three Races, Three Frontrunners You Can Already See",
    "intro": "Award season talk starts early, and the leaderboards aren't leaving much suspense. Houston's bat, Milwaukee's arm, and a White Sox rookie are all running ahead of the field for now.",
